<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Chess Tutorials | ChessMaster</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
            color: #333;
        }

        .container {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #ddd;
            padding: 1rem 0;
        }

        header .container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: #000000;
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: #555;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #000;
        }

        .menu-btn {
            display: none;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: #333;
            cursor: pointer;
            padding: 10px;
        }

        .sidebar {
            position: fixed;
            right: -250px;
            top: 0;
            width: 250px;
            height: 100%;
            background: #333;
            color: white;
            padding-top: 60px;
            transition: right 0.3s;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .sidebar a {
            display: block;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .sidebar a:hover {
            background: #575757;
        }

        .sidebar .profile {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #575757;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .profile-photo {
            width: 30px;
            height: 30px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
            background-image: url('/images/WhatsApp\ Image\ 2023-10-24\ .jpg');
            background-size: cover;
        }

        .close-btn {
            position: absolute;
            top: 10px;
            right: 10px;
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: white;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .close-btn:hover {
            color: #ffcc00;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .menu-btn {
                display: block;
                position: fixed;
                right: 10px;
                top: 10px;
            }

            nav {
                display: none;
            }
        }

        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #9ecae1, #c6dbef);
            padding: 3rem 1rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: #000000;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #444;
        }

        .tutorials {
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 3rem 1rem;
        }

        .tutorials h3 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #1e83af;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .tutorial-card {
            background: #f0f4f8;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin: 1rem auto;
            max-width: 800px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .tutorial-card h4 {
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .tutorial-card p {
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .tutorial-card a {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
            color: #1e40af;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .tutorial-card a:hover {
            color: #2563eb;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <header>
        <div class="container">
            <h1>ChessMaster</h1>
            <button class="menu-btn" onclick="toggleSidebar()">☰</button>
            <nav>
                <a href="/home">Home</a>
                <a href="/profile">Profile</a>
                <a href="/leaderboard">Leaderboard</a>
                <a href="/about">About</a>
                <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
                <a href="/myLogs">Logs</a>
                <a href="/logout">Logout</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
        <div class="profile">
            <img id="profilePhoto" src="<%= profilePhoto %>" alt="Profile" class="profile-photo"
                onerror="this.src='/uploads/default-profile.jpg';">
            <span class="username">
                <%= username %>
            </span>
        </div>
        <button class="close-btn" onclick="toggleSidebar()">&times;</button>
        <a href="/home">Home</a>
        <a href="/profile">Profile</a>
        <a href="/leaderboard">Leaderboard</a>
        <a href="/about">About</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
        <a href="/myLogs">Logs</a>
        <a href="/logout">Logout</a>
    </div>

    <section class="hero">
        <h2>Chess Tutorials</h2>
        <p>Master the game with step-by-step guides, strategies, and expert tips.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="tutorials container">
        <h3>Popular Topics</h3>

        <div class="tutorial-card">
            <h4>♟️ Opening Principles</h4>
            <p>Learn how to control the center, develop your pieces efficiently, and stay safe in the early game.</p>
            <a href="https://www.chess.com/lessons/openings" target="_blank">Start Learning</a>
        </div>

        <div class="tutorial-card">
            <h4>♞ Tactics and Combinations</h4>
            <p>Discover essential tactical patterns like forks, pins, skewers, and more to gain the upper hand.</p>
            <a href="https://lichess.org/practice" target="_blank">Practice Tactics</a>
        </div>

        <div class="tutorial-card">
            <h4>♚ Endgame Basics</h4>
            <p>Understand fundamental endgames like king and pawn vs. king, opposition, and checkmate patterns.</p>
            <a href="https://www.chessable.com/course/100-endgames-you-must-know/20795/" target="_blank">View Course</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <script>
        function toggleSidebar() {
            const sidebar = document.getElementById("sidebar");
            sidebar.style.right = sidebar.style.right === "0px" ? "-250px" : "0";
        }

        window.addEventListener("resize", () => {
            const nav = document.querySelector("nav");
            const menuBtn = document.querySelector(".menu-btn");
            const sidebar = document.getElementById("sidebar");

            if (window.innerWidth <= 768) {
                nav.style.display = "none";
                menuBtn.style.display = "block";
                sidebar.style.right = "-250px";
            } else {
                nav.style.display = "flex";
                menuBtn.style.display = "none";
                sidebar.style.right = "-250px";
            }
        });

        window.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
            const nav = document.querySelector("nav");
            const menuBtn = document.querySelector(".menu-btn");
            const sidebar = document.getElementById("sidebar");

            if (window.innerWidth <= 768) {
                nav.style.display = "none";
                menuBtn.style.display = "block";
                sidebar.style.right = "-250px";
            } else {
                nav.style.display = "flex";
                menuBtn.style.display = "none";
                sidebar.style.right = "-250px";
            }
        });
    </script>
</body>

</html>